+/*
+ * (xnu 0155) One layer scaled by 24/25 onto panel columns [px0, px1) and lines [py0, py1), blended: for each panel
+ * line its place in the layer is (py - band) * 25/24 = line + fraction/24; the two lines are blended into fLine
+ * (two pixels at a time; not at all when the fraction is 0), then each panel pixel blends fLine's column fXMap[i]
+ * with the next by fXWeight[i]. `base` is the layer's first byte, `row` its bytes a line, sx/w its columns, dy/h its
+ * place and lines (as present()); `base` already at the layer's first line (sy).
+ */
